---
// Twitter (X) Recommendation Algorithm & Heavy Ranker Pipeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="twitter-pipe-diagram" aria-labelledby="twitter-pipe-caption">
  <svg
    class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="twitter-pipe-title twitter-pipe-desc"
  >
    <title id="twitter-pipe-title">Twitter 2023 年開源的為你推薦管線架構</title>
    <desc id="twitter-pipe-desc">
      2023 年開源版本：從每天約 5 億則推文中，透過 In-Network (Earlybird) 與
      Out-of-Network (GraphJet/SimClusters) 取出約 1,500 則候選推文，經 Heavy
      Ranker 約 4,800
      萬參數的神經網路評分，再做可見性過濾與多樣性重排，整條管線平均不到 1.5
      秒。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="tpipe-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="tpipe-arrow-accent"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head--accent"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Stage 1: Candidate Retrieval (Left Column) -->
    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="150" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24"
        >STAGE 01: 500M ➔ 1.5K</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="16" y="50">站內候選來源</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="74"
        >• In-Network: Earlybird</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="94"
        >• Lucene 搜尋索引</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="114"
        >• Real Graph 等排序訊號</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="16" y="136"
        >平均約占時間軸一半</text
      >
    </g>

    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 230)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24"
        >STAGE 01: 500M ➔ 1.5K</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="16" y="50">站外候選來源</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="74"
        >• Out-of-Network</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="94"
        >• GraphJet 即時圖遍歷</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="114"
        >• SimClusters 興趣社群</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="134"
        >• 矩陣分解與向量相似度</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="16" y="156"
        >平均約占時間軸一半</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrows from Stage 1 to Home Mixer -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 115 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 315 H 285"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 2: Home Mixer Pipeline Orchestrator -->
    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--mixer"
      transform="translate(290, 110)"
    >
      <rect width="180" height="200" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent"
        x="16"
        y="24">ORCHESTRATOR</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus"
        x="16"
        y="52">Home Mixer</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 推薦管線協調整合</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="100"
        >• 匯聚 1,500 則候選池</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="122"
        >• 取得約 6,000 個特徵</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="144"
        >• 派發至 Heavy Ranker</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent"
        x="16"
        y="180">整條管線平均 &lt;1.5s</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow from Home Mixer to Heavy Ranker -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent"
      d="M 470 210 H 515"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow-accent)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 3: Heavy Ranker (Neural Network) -->
    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--ranker"
      transform="translate(520, 70)"
    >
      <rect width="210" height="280" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--neural"
        x="16"
        y="24">STAGE 02: 1.5K ➔ SCORED</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--neural"
        x="16"
        y="52">Heavy Ranker</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 約 4,800 萬參數 MaskNet</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="100"
        >• 10 種互動機率，例如:</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="122"
        >▫ P(Like) × 0.5</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="142"
        >▫ P(Retweet) × 1</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="162"
        >▫ P(回覆獲作者互動) × 75</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="24" y="182"
        >▫ P(Report) × -369</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="16" y="208"
        >• 依權重加總成分數</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--neural"
        x="16"
        y="254">權重：2023-04-05 版</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow from Heavy Ranker to Filters & Re-ranking -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent"
      d="M 730 210 H 775"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow-accent)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 4: Filtering & Final Timeline Output -->
    <g class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card" transform="translate(780, 40)">
      <rect width="150" height="150" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge" x="14" y="24"
        >STAGE 03: FILTER</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title" x="14" y="50">可見性過濾</text>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74"
        >• 封鎖 / 靜音過濾</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• NSFW / 合規過濾</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• 負面回饋降分</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag" x="14" y="136"
        >移除已看過的推文</text
      >
    </g>

    <g
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__card twitter-pipe-diagram__card--output"
      transform="translate(780, 230)"
    >
      <rect width="150" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__badge twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent"
        x="14"
        y="24">STAGE 04: OUTPUT</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__title twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus"
        x="14"
        y="50">多樣性重排</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="74">• 作者多樣性</text>
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="94"
        >• 廣告 / 推薦穿插</text
      >
      <text class="twitter-pipe-diagram__desc" x="14" y="114"
        >• 最終推薦時間軸</text
      >
      <text
        class="twitter-pipe-diagram__tag twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent"
        x="14"
        y="156">Top-N 渲染交付</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Flow connection in Stage 4 -->
    <path
      class="twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 855 190 V 225"
      marker-end="url(#tpipe-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="twitter-pipe-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge">01. 候選檢索 (500M ➔ 1500)</span>
      <h4>雙軌候選檢索 (Candidate Sources)</h4>
      <p>
        關注圈內（Earlybird 搜尋索引）+ 關注圈外（GraphJet 即時互動圖與
        SimClusters 社群嵌入），兩者平均各占時間軸一半，因人而異。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 整合 1,500 則候選推文</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--mixer">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent"
        >02. 管線協調中心</span
      >
      <h4>Home Mixer 與特徵工程</h4>
      <p>匯集候選推文，取得約 6,000 個排序特徵，交給 Heavy Ranker 評分。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 神經網路評分</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--ranker">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--neural"
        >03. 核心評分模型</span
      >
      <h4>Heavy Ranker (約 48M 參數 MaskNet)</h4>
      <p>預測按讚、轉發、回覆、檢舉等 10 種互動機率，再依權重加總成分數。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow">↓ 業務合規與重排</div>

    <div class="twitter-pipe-mobile-card twitter-pipe-mobile-card--output">
      <span class="twitter-pipe-mobile-badge twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent"
        >04. 過濾與多樣性重排</span
      >
      <h4>Visibility Filtering &amp; Heuristics</h4>
      <p>
        排除封鎖、靜音與 NSFW
        內容，避免同一作者連續出現，再穿插廣告與追蹤推薦。整條管線平均不到 1.5
        秒。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="twitter-pipe-caption">
    圖 1：Twitter 2023 年開源的推薦管線：雙軌候選檢索、Home Mixer 協調、Heavy
    Ranker 神經網路與多樣性重排。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .twitter-pipe-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--dg-surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .twitter-pipe-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--mixer rect {
    fill: #eff6ff;
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--mixer rect {
    fill: #172554;
    stroke: #2563eb;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--ranker rect {
    fill: #faf5ff;
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--ranker rect {
    fill: #2e1065;
    stroke: #7c3aed;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--output rect {
    fill: #f0fdf4;
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__card--output rect {
    fill: #064e3b;
    stroke: #059669;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--accent {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--neural {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__badge--neural {
    fill: #c084fc;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus {
    fill: #1d4ed8;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__title--focus {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__title--neural {
    fill: #6b21a8;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__title--neural {
    fill: #d8b4fe;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__tag {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--accent {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--neural {
    fill: #9333ea;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__tag--neural {
    fill: #e9d5ff;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow--accent {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head--accent {
    fill: #3b82f6;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-diagram__arrow-head--accent {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .twitter-pipe-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--mixer {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      background: #eff6ff;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--mixer {
      background: #172554;
      border-color: #2563eb;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--ranker {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: #faf5ff;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--ranker {
      background: #2e1065;
      border-color: #7c3aed;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--output {
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent {
      color: #2563eb;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--accent {
      color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--neural {
      color: #7c3aed;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-mobile-badge--neural {
      color: #c084fc;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .twitter-pipe-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .twitter-pipe-mobile-card--output {
    border-left: 4px solid #3ddc9a;
  }
</style>
